id: pm-github-privacy-store-followup
title: Resolve an unrelated unreachable commit identity reported by whole-store privacy checks
description: "The pm-github-vhi6 unchanged baseline completed 1609 tests with 1607 passes and two privacy-test failures. Both report identity:commit on object 42297ee8e9a40cf0f5312eaeb079d95de0c01f67, which is not reachable from the bounded-coverage branch or any listed branch. The existing privacy gate deliberately audits all local objects, including unreachable objects. Investigate the provenance and obtain an explicitly authorized identity/store repair; do not weaken the gate, expand the allowlist automatically, delete shared objects or rewrite history as part of the coverage task. Final branch validation should also report an independent clone result separately from shared-store health."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: follow-up,gates,privacy
created_at: "2026-11-03T03:25:29.796Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-03T07:09:03.631Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-03T07:08:36.275Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-03T07:08:59.000Z"
author: codex-sol
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-03T07:00:29.443Z",codex-sol,"Independent branch validation completed with the full privacy gate unchanged: 3718 objects passed, and both repository privacy tests passed in the 1609/1609 full release run. This confirms the baseline failure depends on the unrelated shared object store; it does not repair or certify that store. No identity allowlist, object deletion or history rewrite was performed. Follow-up remains open for the owner."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  scripts/privacy-gate.ts,project
  test/privacy-gate.test.ts,project
docs[1]{path,scope}:
  docs/bounded-coverage-merge.md,project
close_reason: "Resolved by the orchestrator (2026-11-03): 42297ee came from a sub-agent commit on pm-github#214 that used a mistyped noreply identity. Those commits were re-authored as the fleet identity before merge (#214 merged clean). The orchestrator then expired the reflogs naming the old commits and deleted the loose objects 42297ee and db3c180, whose trees match the re-authored commits. git cat-file -e 42297ee now fails in the shared store, and npm run privacy over the shared store passes (8228 objects, all identities approved, run for pm-github#213 at 06:50Z). Gate and allowlist unchanged."
body: ""
